    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1857">

                <pb facs="1220" n="1104" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg1104"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 701.3111/40.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister McGoodwin.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-06-26">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 26, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Department was grieved this morning to learn of the death of the Minister of
                    Venezuela at this capital. Call in person at Foreign <pb facs="1221" n="1105"
                        xml:id="pg1105"/> Office and express suitable condolences and say that this
                    Government has offered its services to the Chargé d’Affaires. I have cabled
                    condolences to Minister Foreign Affairs.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">W. J. Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
